---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-[rgba(206,66,43,0.3)] py-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">

    <div>
      <p class="font-mono font-semibold text-[#f0f0f0] text-sm">
        <span class="text-[#ce422b]">vs</span><span class="text-[#909090]">_</span>shuvalov
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-[0.6875rem] text-[#5c6370] mt-0.5">// Software Engineer · Go · Rust · Python</p>
    </div>

    <p class="font-mono text-[0.75rem] text-[#5c6370]">
      © {year} Vladislav Shuvalov. Built with Astro &amp; Tailwind.
    </p>

  </div>
</footer>
